WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:05.088
I don’t suppose ya know much about the Wolfwalkers, do ya?

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:09.009
A long time ago,

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:11.594
the Irish were mad superstitious.

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:14.681
Tellin’ tales like the Man-Wolves of Ossory.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:19.394
Men and women who were cursed to live in the forest as wolves,

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:21.688
while their human bodies lay sleepin’.

00:00:22.647 --> 00:00:26.901
Back then, they believed anything wild was the work of the devil.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:29.738
'Cos these Wolfwalkers, they call 'em,

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:32.073
are said to have a wild kinda magic.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:36.536
Healin’ powers that can vanish what ails ya out of thin air.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:40.707
They can even see smells with their wolf vision...

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:43.835
Oh, and be careful, they bite.

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:47.547
'Cos if ya bitten...you’ll be a Wolfwalker, too.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.258
How do I know, ya ask?

00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:52.594
'Cos I am one.

